{"root_cause":"The vanilla-calendar-pro (VCP) calendar, when shown, attaches a keydown handler to the datepicker input that calls preventDefault() on the Tab key, blocking focus movement to the next form field.","repair_strategy":"Add a capture-phase keydown listener on the datepicker input that hides the calendar on Tab press and calls stopImmediatePropagation() to prevent VCP's handler from running and calling preventDefault(), allowing the default focus movement to proceed.","edits":[{"path":"js/src/datepicker.ts","sha256":"333ada052b9200667edf9078b105036dee5c1406a86e3865f6534e2ddb18c53a","before":"  protected declare _element: HTMLElement & { value: string }
